T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem: Find the center of mass \(x_bar, y_bar\) of a uniform thin semi-circular plate of) Tj
T*
(radius a lying in the upper half plane x^2 + y^2 <= a^2, y >= 0.) Tj
T*
(Solution Step 1: Symmetry consideration: The laminar disc is symmetric about the y-axis) Tj
T*
(\(x = 0\).) Tj
T*
(Therefore, x_bar = 0.) Tj
T*
(Solution Step 2: Total area of semi-circle: Area A = pi * a^2 / 2.) Tj
T*
(Solution Step 3: Compute first moment of area M_x = iint_R y dA in polar coordinates:) Tj
T*
(y = r*sin\(theta\), dA = r dr d\(theta\).) Tj
T*
(M_x = int_0^pi [ int_0^a \(r*sin\(theta\)\) * r dr ] d\(theta\) = int_0^pi sin\(theta\) d\(theta\)) Tj
T*
(* int_0^a r^2 dr.) Tj
T*
(Angular integral: int_0^pi sin\(theta\) d\(theta\) = [ -cos\(theta\) ]_0^pi = 1 - \(-1\) = 2.) Tj
T*
(Radial integral: int_0^a r^2 dr = [ r^3 / 3 ]_0^a = a^3 / 3.) Tj
T*
(M_x = 2 * \(a^3 / 3\) = 2*a^3 / 3.) Tj
T*
(Solution Step 4: Calculate centroid coordinate y_bar:) Tj
T*
(y_bar = M_x / Area = [ 2*a^3 / 3 ] / [ pi * a^2 / 2 ] = \(2*a^3 / 3\) * \(2 / \(pi * a^2\)\) =) Tj
T*
(4*a / \(3*pi\).) Tj
T*
(Final Centroid Coordinates: \(x_bar, y_bar\) = \( 0, 4a / \(3*pi\) \). For a = 3 m, y_bar ~) Tj
T*
(1.273 m.) Tj
